<title>USA: Haverty Furniture Cos Inc sets qtly divs.</title>
<headline>Haverty Furniture Cos Inc sets qtly divs.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Haverty Furniture said it declared a quarterly dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.08		     $0.08</p>
<p> Pay		    Feb 27</p>
<p> Record		 Feb 17</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>Haverty Furniture also said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class A common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.075		    $0.075</p>
<p> Pay		    Feb 27</p>
<p> Record		 Feb 17</p>
<p>NOTE: Haverty Furniture Cos Inc.</p>
</text>
